  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r2" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "cipher's commit 0ca3485cc (chore(doctor): split scope orchestration and refresh CLI docs) extracted DoctorTeamScope resolution/looping logic (teams_for_scope, load_scoped_rosters, graft_receivers_for_teams, presence_findings_for_team/scope_finding, push_doctor_error_for_team) into a new sibling module crates/atm-core/src/doctor/team_scope.rs (114 lines), exactly the structural split this finding's fix direction recommended. PR #1300 head advanced 6189ad3f5 -> 98ac5c7d2 (0ca3485cc + 98ac5c7d2 docs(cli): normalize generated reference EOF). Re-ran python3 .just/check_line_counts.py directly at 98ac5c7d2 in the feature/ay13-doctor-team-scope worktree: 'RULE-003 check passed: source file size limits satisfied' -- crates/atm-core/src/doctor/mod.rs now prod=947 (was 1042), doctor/team_scope.rs prod=106. No other production module crossed the 1000-line cap as a side effect. Closing on this evidence." .
